t\", \"q\": \"Analyses compared changes in the crude rate of fentanyl submissions, fentanyl prescriptions, and synthetic opioid deaths during 2013–2014 using Pearson correlations.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"States were classified as high-burden if they experienced a 1-year increase in synthetic opioid deaths exceeding two per 100,000 residents\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Gamma tests were used if cell count was less than 100 in 2013 or 2014\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"z-tests were used if cell counts were ≥100 in both 2013 and 2014\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Cells with nine or fewer deaths are not reported and rates based on <20 deaths are not considered reliable and not reported.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}